    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild left thumb-base ache after long work; no joint swelling or foot pain</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Finger wound healed; no rash</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No numbness in the hand; no dizziness or falls</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>3 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

